# =====================================================================
# Tesco Customer Support AI Assistant — Environment Configuration
# =====================================================================
# NOTE: The entire system runs 100% OFFLINE without any API credentials
# by passing --provider mock (zero API costs, hermetic execution).
#
# If you wish to run live generation and LLM judging, configure one of:
# =====================================================================

# Option A: Google Gemini API (Recommended for live runs)
# Get a key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Option B: OpenAI API (gpt-4o-mini)
# Get a key at: https://platform.openai.com/
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Option C: Ollama Local Models (100% Free, Unlimited)
# Run: ollama run llama3.1:8b
# OLLAMA_API_KEY=not_required_for_localhost
